    "label": "考虑由 Y(s)/U(s)=1/(s+3) 描述的电动机转速系统。设计该系统使其具有积分控制并在 s=-5 处具有两个极点。设计一个极点位于 s=-10 处的状态估计器。扰动在与控制输入相同的位置进入。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Consider the motor speed system described by Y(s)/U(s)=1/(s+3). Design the system to have integral control and two poles at s=-5. Design an estimator with pole at s=-10. The disturbance enters at the same place as the control.",
